# GCP service-account keys must never be committed. The deploy docs say where to
# put them on the host (/opt/khmer-ai-cs/vertex-sa.json, 600); this is the second
# line of defence for the case where someone exports one into the repo instead.
# See deploy-khmer-ai-cs/SKILL.md "Vertex 切换".
*-sa.json
vertex-sa.json
service-account*.json
